NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type EmbeddingContentParts = (\n  | TextPart\n  | ImagePart)[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3058","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:3058"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A fused multi-part embedding item: all parts are embedded together into a\nsingle vector (e.g. a product photo plus its caption). Written as a nested\narray of content parts — the same "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Array<ContentPart>"},{"type":"text","value":" convention chat\nmessages use — so a fused item is visually distinct from the top-level\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"input"},{"type":"text","value":" list, where each element produces its own vector. Supported by\nmultimodal embedding models such as Cohere embed-v4 and Amazon Titan\nMultimodal."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype EmbeddingContentParts = (\n  | TextPart\n  | ImagePart)[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3058](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3058)\n\nA fused multi-part embedding item: all parts are embedded together into a\nsingle vector (e.g. a product photo plus its caption). Written as a nested\narray of content parts — the same `Array<ContentPart>` convention chat\nmessages use — so a fused item is visually distinct from the top-level\n`input` list, where each element produces its own vector. Supported by\nmultimodal embedding models such as Cohere embed-v4 and Amazon Titan\nMultimodal.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: EmbeddingContentParts\ntitle: EmbeddingContentParts\n---\n\n```ts\ntype EmbeddingContentParts = (\n  | TextPart\n  | ImagePart)[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:3058](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L3058)\n\nA fused multi-part embedding item: all parts are embedded together into a\nsingle vector (e.g. a product photo plus its caption). Written as a nested\narray of content parts — the same `Array<ContentPart>` convention chat\nmessages use — so a fused item is visually distinct from the top-level\n`input` list, where each element produces its own vector. Supported by\nmultimodal embedding models such as Cohere embed-v4 and Amazon Titan\nMultimodal.\n"}
